{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"chatcmpl-ef8b215c-d38b-4dd2-ac9b-4f1ce59b60be","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"chatcmpl-tool-99183e9c00754e73","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/private/var/folders/h5/l8qslbp55w5621qf9ngsh5jc0000gn/T/epic-RHAISTRAT-9018-_atyc13s/artifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9018-E002.md","content":"# Dashboard admin view: current-month GPU consumption against Kueue quota\n\n## Description\n\nThis epic delivers the administrator-facing Dashboard view that shows each\nproject's current-month GPU-hour consumption alongside its Kueue quota, so\nplatform administrators can see how much of each project's quota is being\nconsumed on the shared GPU clusters.\n\n## Scope\n\n- An administrator-facing view in the Dashboard console presenting per-project\n  current-month GPU-hour consumption against each project's Kueue quota.\n- Consumption figures sourced from the chargeback reporting capability\n  delivered by this strategy (the reporting backend with its retrieval surface)\n  — the Dashboard must not re-implement report computation or metering\n  collection.\n- Quota figures reflecting each project's Kueue quota as configured in the\n  platform (ClusterQueue/LocalQueue quota model, read via the Dashboard's\n  existing Kubernetes-API-based integration pattern).\n- Placement in the Dashboard's administrator-facing area, consistent with\n  existing Dashboard integration patterns (navigation, resource views).\n\nOut of scope: the report computation, CSV export, and retrieval API (owned by\nthe Distributed Workloads team); the metering collection pipeline\n(RHAISTRAT-9990).\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- The Dashboard presents, in its administrator-facing area, a view listing\n  projects with their current-month GPU-hour consumption shown against their\n  Kueue quota.\n- For a project with known metered usage and a configured quota, the view\n  displays the consumption and quota figures that match the reporting backend's\n  computed values for the current month.\n- The consumption data displayed is traceable to the chargeback reporting\n  capability (no report computation or metering collection implemented in the\n  Dashboard) — verified by code review.\n- The view renders for administrators of the platform and follows the\n  Dashboard's established integration patterns.\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n| HLR | Priority | Coverage |\n|---|---|---|\n| HLR-3 | P1 | The Dashboard admin view shows current-month consumption against each project's Kueue quota. |\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":50423,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-8488c55fed33c571","agent_id":"a1241bd17138ca9eb","session_id":"4d2ca8ec-aba3-41c6-ac00-7fc0c2659d24","uuid":"6931a6c0-258e-48b1-a5f8-d72b199089ab","timestamp":"2026-10-25T18:01:49.858Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9018"}
