{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"chatcmpl-e793ea58-09c4-437b-85ed-0b44c3725957","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"chatcmpl-tool-8c6c8be6d65a0acc","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/private/var/folders/h5/l8qslbp55w5621qf9ngsh5jc0000gn/T/epic-RHAISTRAT-9018-_atyc13s/artifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9018-E003.md","content":"# Chargeback reporting documentation: report semantics and export integration\n\n## Description\n\nThis epic delivers the user-facing documentation for GPU chargeback reporting:\nwhat the reports mean (including what counts as a GPU-hour) and how finance\ntooling integrates with the CSV export and the stable retrieval API. The\ndocumentation is written after the reporting backend and Dashboard admin view\nare implemented, and describes what was actually built.\n\n## Scope\n\nContent outline:\n\n- **Report semantics topic**: what a per-project GPU-hour consumption report\n  contains, what counts as a GPU-hour (how metered usage is attributed to a\n  project and aggregated over a time range), how time ranges are selected, and\n  how consumption relates to each project's Kueue quota in the Dashboard admin\n  view.\n- **Export integration topic**: how to export reports as CSV and how to retrieve\n  reports programmatically via the stable reporting API, aimed at finance\n  tooling integrators (authentication, request patterns, and the report data\n  contract as implemented).\n\nThe documentation reflects the implemented behavior of the chargeback reporting\nbackend and the Dashboard admin view, not aspirational behavior.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- A published documentation topic covers report semantics, including an explicit\n  definition of what counts as a GPU-hour and how per-project consumption is\n  attributed and aggregated.\n- A published documentation topic covers export integration: CSV export and API\n  retrieval for finance tooling, matching the implemented API contract.\n- The documentation is technically reviewed against the implemented chargeback\n  reporting backend and Dashboard admin view, with review sign-off recorded.\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n| HLR | Priority | Coverage |\n|---|---|---|\n| HLR-4 | P2 | Documentation covers report semantics (what counts as a GPU-hour) and export integration. |\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":51035,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-8488c55fed33c571","agent_id":"a1241bd17138ca9eb","session_id":"4d2ca8ec-aba3-41c6-ac00-7fc0c2659d24","uuid":"1259d5a7-6e98-436b-9ce9-97d62c4e1e77","timestamp":"2026-10-25T18:01:58.144Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9018"}
