table reporting API, aimed at finance\n52\t  tooling integrators (authentication, request patterns, and the report data\n53\t  contract as implemented).\n54\t\n55\tThe documentation reflects the implemented behavior of the chargeback reporting\n56\tbackend and the Dashboard admin view, not aspirational behavior.\n57\t\n58\t## Acceptance Criteria\n59\t\n60\t- A published documentation topic covers report semantics, including an explicit\n61\t  definition of what counts as a GPU-hour and how per-project consumption is\n62\t  attributed and aggregated.\n63\t- A published documentation topic covers export integration: CSV export and API\n64\t  retrieval for finance tooling, matching the implemented API contract.\n65\t- The documentation is technically reviewed against the implemented chargeback\n66\t  reporting backend and Dashboard admin view, with review sign-off recorded.\n67\t\n68\t## HLR Traceability\n69\t\n70\t| HLR | Priority | Coverage |\n71\t|---|---|---|\n72\t| HLR-4 | P2 | Documentation covers report semantics (what counts as a GPU-hour) and export integration. |\n73\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-ba2ba58f480c16d6","agent_id":"a944714db2c226faa","session_id":"4d2ca8ec-aba3-41c6-ac00-7fc0c2659d24","uuid":"10016150-c005-44aa-afe5-98752acda59c","timestamp":"2026-10-25T18:06:48.185Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-8d2b72fde795df43","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Revise RHAISTRAT-9018 decomposition"}
