ashboard's administrator-facing area, consistent with\n51\t  existing Dashboard integration patterns (navigation, resource views).\n52\t\n53\tOut of scope: the report computation, CSV export, and retrieval API (owned by\n54\tthe Distributed Workloads team); the metering collection pipeline\n55\t(RHAISTRAT-9990).\n56\t\n57\t## Acceptance Criteria\n58\t\n59\t- The Dashboard presents, in its administrator-facing area, a view listing\n60\t  projects with their current-month GPU-hour consumption shown against their\n61\t  Kueue quota.\n62\t- For a project with known metered usage and a configured quota, the view\n63\t  displays the consumption and quota figures that match the reporting backend's\n64\t  computed values for the current month.\n65\t- The consumption data displayed is traceable to the chargeback reporting\n66\t  capability (no report computation or metering collection implemented in the\n67\t  Dashboard) — verified by code review.\n68\t- The view renders for administrators of the platform and follows the\n69\t  Dashboard's established integration patterns.\n70\t\n71\t## HLR Traceability\n72\t\n73\t| HLR | Priority | Coverage |\n74\t|---|---|---|\n75\t| HLR-3 | P1 | The Dashboard admin view shows current-month consumption against each project's Kueue quota. |\n76\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a0aab55906adba82","agent_id":"af0f2ce9af0189870","session_id":"4d2ca8ec-aba3-41c6-ac00-7fc0c2659d24","uuid":"1ee7a18e-1267-4b2a-b4df-9085e9f818f8","timestamp":"2026-10-25T18:08:17.388Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-a15b055bb0bfb66b","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Re-review revised decomposition"}
